    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "现在是星期三晚上八点。大星和爸爸妈妈在家看电影。",
      "traditional": "現在是星期三晚上八點。大星和爸爸媽媽在家看電影。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài shì xīng qī sān wǎn shang bā diǎn dà xīng hé bà ba mā ma zài jiā kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": "It was eight o’clock on a Wednesday evening. Daxing and his parents were watching a movie at home. "
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "昨天，大星爸爸的身体好了。他不住在医院了，他回家了。",
      "traditional": "昨天，大星爸爸的身體好了。他不住在醫院了，他回家了。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān dà xīng bà ba de shēn tǐ hǎo le tā bú zhù zài yī yuàn le tā huí jiā le",
      "english": "Yesterday, Daxing’s dad recovered. He wasn’t at the hospital anymore. He had returned home."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "医生说这个星期爸爸要多睡觉，不能工作。",
      "traditional": "醫生說這個星期爸爸要多睡覺，不能工作。",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng shuō zhè ge xīng qī bà ba yào duō shuì jiào bù néng gōng zuò",
      "english": "The doctor said that this week Dad must sleep more and couldn’t work."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "昨天我的身体也好了。大星和我去了一个小店。",
      "traditional": "昨天我的身體也好了。大星和我去了一個小店。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān wǒ de shēn tǐ yě hǎo le dà xīng hé wǒ qù le yí ge xiǎo diàn",
      "english": "Yesterday, I also recovered. Daxing and I went to a small shop. "
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "现在，我的身体上有字了，我能打电话了，我也能打开APP了。",
      "traditional": "現在，我的身體上有字了，我能打電話了，我也能打開APP了。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wǒ de shēn tǐ shang yǒu zì le wǒ néng dǎ diàn huà le wǒ yě néng dǎ kāi 3 le",
      "english": "Now I had characters on my body, I could make calls, and I could open apps."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我想：“我要做一个好手机。”",
      "traditional": "我想：“我要做一個好手機。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng wǒ yào zuò yí ge hǎo shǒu jī",
      "english": "I thought, “I want to be a good phone.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "现在我在桌子上面。我没和大星在一起，但是没关系。大星高兴，我高兴。",
      "traditional": "現在我在桌子上面。我沒和大星在一起，但是沒關係。大星高興，我高興。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wǒ zài zhuō zi shàng miàn wǒ méi hé dà xīng zài yì qǐ dàn shì méi guān xi dà xīng gāo xìng wǒ gāo xìng",
      "english": "Now I was on the table. I wasn’t together with Daxing, but it didn’t matter. If Daxing was happy, I was happy."
    },
    {
