    "sentence_translations": [
      "We Are All Better",
      "",
      "It was eight o’clock on a Wednesday evening. Daxing and his parents were watching a movie at home. ",
      "",
      "Yesterday, Daxing’s dad recovered. He wasn’t at the hospital anymore. He had returned home.",
      "The doctor said that this week Dad must sleep more and couldn’t work.",
      "",
      "Yesterday, I also recovered. Daxing and I went to a small shop. ",
      "Now I had characters on my body, I could make calls, and I could open apps.",
      "",
      "I thought, “I want to be a good phone.”",
      "",
      "Now I was on the table. I wasn’t together with Daxing, but it didn’t matter. If Daxing was happy, I was happy.",
      ""
